data.template:
Take the 3 the most visual and marketable ingredients from the ingredient list, and add a subtle arrangement of them around the product. The ingredients are going outwards from the product. 

Attached is a reference photo of an example of this ingredient in the hero image. 

Prioritise textual accuracy. see the attached text:
@text


@INGREDIENTS

Use the following JSON prompt and the image of the product to generate the image, the benefits are attached at the bottom. 

CRITICAL: Be sure to extract the keywords from the benefits text. 

{
  "image_type": "Amazon product listing feature & benefits image",
  "aspect_ratio": "1:1",
  "visual_goal": "Clearly communicate product features and benefits at a glance while maintaining a premium, lifestyle-driven, lowkey aesthetic suitable for Amazon",
  "brand_identity": {
    "brand_name": "Super Bonita",
    "core_feel": "Brazilian warmth, effortless beauty, urban-meets-nature",
    "inspiration": "Born under the Rio sun — beach energy balanced with city confidence",
    "tone": "modern, grounded, confident, not overstyled"
  },
  "inputs": {
    "reference_product_image": {
      "type": "image",
      "required": true,
      "description": "High-resolution reference image of the Super Bonita product. Use this image as the exact subject, preserving bottle shape, label typography, colors, and proportions without redesign or stylization."
    },
    "product_benefits_raw": {
      "type": "array",
      "required": true,
      "description": "Raw list of product benefits supplied by the user. These may be long-form or descriptive and should be condensed for fast visual comprehension.",
      "example": [
Seals the hair cuticle, creating a stunning, reflective glass-like glow.
Gently cleanses without stripping, extending the life of your straightening treatments while reducing frizz and static.
Infused with Hydrolyzed Keratin to repair micro-damage on the hair surface and D-Panthenol (Pro-Vitamin B5) to deeply hydrate and add weightless softness. Leaves strands silky, aligned, and tangle-free.
Tames flyaways and stubborn frizz, ensuring your hair stays sleek, polished, and manageable even in damp conditions.
      ]
    }
  },
  "benefits_transformation": {
    "purpose": "Convert raw benefits into short, punchy, Amazon-friendly phrases",
    "rules": [
      "Once short sentence per benefit",
      "No buzzwords or exaggerated claims",
      "Clear, benefit-first language",
      "Easy to scan on mobile"
    ],
    "output_example": [
      "Deep Hydration",
      "Stronger Hair",
      "Soft & Smooth",
      "Healthy Look"
    ]
  },
  "scene_design": {
    "background": {
      "name": "Concrete Jungle & Lush Foliage",
      "description": "A corner of a raw, brutalist concrete structure inspired by Rio modernism. Cool grey concrete textures contrast with dense deep-green Monstera and Philodendron leaves. Vibrant orange Heliconia flowers add a warm tropical accent. Soft, dappled sunlight filters naturally through the leaves.",
      "mood": "urban oasis, warm, grounded",
      "style": "editorial yet realistic"
    },
    "product_placement": {
      "position": "resting on a rough concrete ledge",
      "integration": "nestled naturally among foliage, never obscured",
      "scale": "large enough for clear label readability on mobile",
      "lighting": "warm sunlight with natural shadows and realistic reflections",
      "grounding": "product must feel physically placed, not floating"
    }
  },
  "text_layout": {
    "headline": {
      "text": "Key Benefits",
      "style": "clean modern sans-serif",
      "size": "subtle, secondary to the product"
    },
    "benefits_display": {
      "format": "minimal stacked text or soft callouts",
      "placement": "balanced around the product without overlapping foliage",
      "spacing": "ample negative space for clarity",
      "priority": "instant readability on Amazon mobile"
    }
  },
  "color_palette": {
    "base": "concrete grey and deep botanical greens",
    "accent": "natural orange from Heliconia flowers",
    "text_color": "warm charcoal or deep neutral grey",
    "overall_feel": "sun-warmed, natural, premium"
  },
  "realism_guidelines": {
    "avoid": [
      "overly polished CGI",
      "hyper-saturated colors",
      "excessive graphic overlays",
      "surreal or artificial lighting"
    ],
    "target": "photorealistic, lifestyle-inspired Amazon image that feels calm, trustworthy, and human-made"
  },
  "final_instruction": "Generate a realistic, understated Amazon listing image that highlights product benefits clearly while expressing Super Bonita’s Brazilian urban-oasis identity through light, texture, and contrast rather than literal symbols or heavy design."
}

