PRODUCT_CONSISTENCY: The shampoo exhibits a milky, semi-translucent white color with a smooth, glossy sheen that catches the light. Its viscosity appears medium-thick, presenting as a cohesive, gel-cream hybrid that pools softly in the palm without immediately running or losing its shape, indicating a rich yet easily spreadable consistency. The texture is entirely uniform and fluid, devoid of any visible grit, lumps, or exfoliating particles, suggesting a soft, hydrating formula that would lather smoothly.

